{#intro}
@summary: What IATF is and why the split index model exists
# Introduction

IATF keeps an INDEX cache and CONTENT source-of-truth in one file.
Start with {@workflow} to see the operational loop.
{/intro}

{#workflow}
@summary: Command flow used by agents and humans
# Workflow

1. Run `iatf rebuild` after editing CONTENT.
2. Run `iatf validate` before publishing.
3. Use `iatf index`, `iatf find`, and `iatf read` for retrieval.
{/workflow}

{#next-steps}
@summary: Follow-up actions after validating a document
# Next Steps

